<p>Fires a blast of void energies that slowly travel to their target, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">146, 197, 236, 269, 299</acronym> arcane damage on impact.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>